      "claim": "Methoxyphenol/fused-ring analogs 2-methoxyestradiol and estradiol show oral bioavailability of about 1–5%, with L2 rat values of 3.04% and 2.9%, indicating extensive first-pass metabolism for this phenolic/methoxy scaffold.",
      "card_ids": ["C53", "C34", "C28", "C14", "C38", "C48", "C56", "C102"]
