      "claim": "High-F comparator records (ethinyl estradiol 51%, drospirenone 76–85%) and L2 outliers (pentazocine ~20–30%, estradiol 30–40%) are structurally distinct or inconsistent with more direct measurements and do not transfer to the query.",
